# SolarEPC-Pro Phase 3: Professional EPC Modules

## Goal Description
Align the project with the "8-Module Professional EPC" curriculum. This involves removing the Battery Storage (BESS) system and adding deep engineering tools for Inverter Sizing, Site Geometry (Row Spacing), and generating a commercial-grade PDF Feasibility Report.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **BESS Removal**: The Battery Storage module will be completely removed from the codebase and UI.
> **PDF Generation**: We will use `fpdf` to generate reports. The report will include static charts (saved as images from Plotly) if possible, or just tables and metrics for the first iteration to ensure stability.

