## Verification Plan
### Automated Tests
- `test_design.py`:
    - Verify row spacing calculation for a known latitude (e.g., 35°N).
    - Verify inverter checks (e.g., fail if Voc > Vmax).
- `test_reporting.py`:
    - Verify PDF file is created and has non-zero size.

### Manual Verification
- Run app, verify BESS is gone.
- Input a system with high DC/AC ratio (e.g., 1.5) and check if warning appears.
- Download PDF and check formatting.
